  era: "Section 17 \xB7 Regional Powers \xB7 18th century"
  title: Peshwas
  text: From Balaji Vishwanath in 1713, the Peshwas, or chief ministers, led the Maratha state from Pune. Baji Rao the First expanded Maratha power north, and the Marathas reached Delhi and Attock, but suffered a heavy defeat by Ahmad Shah Abdali at Panipat in 1761.
